# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Docker build-context ignore for Shipyard.
#
# The build context is the repo root. We deliberately copy only manifests first
# (for cached installs) and then `src`, so this file keeps the context small and
# — critically — prevents host build artifacts and secrets from leaking into the
# image. Everything is rebuilt cleanly inside the image.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Dependencies (re-installed in the image)
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Build outputs (re-built in the image)
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo

# Prisma generated client (re-generated in the image)
packages/db/generated

# Secrets & env — NEVER copy into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# VCS / CI
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Tests / coverage
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea
.vscode

# Local docs/scratch not needed at build time
**/*.log
logs
data
.shipyard

# Docker artifacts themselves
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
infra/docker/docker-compose*.yml
